OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	The Broken Seal
Description	Two keepers dig toward a sealed vault, and something inside answers. Hero waves pour from the middle at both of you. 2 players. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in ruins, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

